      "id": "AID-TRACK-001",
      "issue": "Player Aid displays Soviet replacement count 5 for mud turns 3 and 4, while the bundled oberlabs_2009_web rules profile uses 4. This is a genuine source/profile difference; preserve Oberlabs profile pending independent reference confirmation.",
